 "remarks": "All updated colonial house with new appliances and a new kitchen. A cozy covered porch overlooking a lovely fully fenced front yard with white trellis. 3 min walking distance to the West beach. Very close to stores and restaurants (many of them are a walking distance), train station and downtown Stamford. Very convenient commute to everywhere. Save on vacations and live in this water community which is the most desirable location in Stamford. Also, a furnished option is available for $5,500.",
